; ZX Spectrum +2A/+3 system variables at #5B00 for the Xpeccy+ debugger: the
; names and addresses of the ZX Spectrum +3 manual, chapter 8 part 25. Part of
; Xpeccy+, MIT license.
;
; @ram <bank>: names of RAM cells in that bank, at the CPU address it
; has at #4000-#7FFF
@ns P3ROM0
@ram 5
